    "detailed_description": "The original Sinking Simulator from 2013 now on Steam!<br />\r\nFor all fans of Sandbox focused on Chaos and Destruction!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEver wanted to sink the Titanic? or perhaps Destroy the Eiffel Tower?  What about flooding buildings?<br />\r\nAll of this is possible through soft body physics interaction generated by your own PNG images.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSimply follow the color palette provided with the game and let your artistic side take over!<br />\r\nThe materials are defined by a Json file which you can modify to add your own!<br />\r\nThis legacy edition contain 4 versions of the game, all available through the Beta Tab.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis steam release is meant for those who are unable to run the most recent Sinking Simulator and wishes to have a similar albeit downscaled experience.<br />\r\nThis is also meant as a way to help preserve the game to ensure it remains available for as long as possible.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhile this version of the game is no longer in active development, the funds generated by the sales will help toward future projects",
